==================================================
NATIVE SQL SERVER BACKUP
==================================================

For each database execute a native SQL Server backup equivalent to:

BACKUP DATABASE [database]
TO DISK = <generated backup path>
WITH
    COPY_ONLY,
    CHECKSUM,
    COMPRESSION,
    INIT,
    NAME = <descriptive backup-set name>,
    DESCRIPTION = <database + full copy-only + 2026-10-02>,
    STATS = 5;

Do NOT use DIFFERENTIAL.

Do NOT use NO_CHECKSUM.

Do NOT use CONTINUE_AFTER_ERROR.

Do NOT use SKIP.

Do NOT use FORMAT.

BACKUP DATABASE failure for either database must stop the workflow.

Do not proceed as if the backup succeeded.

==================================================
